---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div class="footer-content">
		<div class="copyright">
			<span class="copyright-symbol">&copy;</span>
			<span class="copyright-year">{today.getFullYear()}</span>
			<span class="copyright-name">ChenYang</span>
			<span class="copyright-divider">·</span>
			<span class="copyright-site">CG艺术实验室</span>
		</div>
		<p class="footer-tagline">工具是人类肢体的延伸，电脑是大脑的延伸，写作是思考本身。</p>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	footer {
		padding: 3rem 1rem 4rem;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, var(--color-bg-secondary) 100%);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
		text-align: center;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
	}

	.footer-content {
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.copyright {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.25rem;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.copyright-symbol {
		margin-right: 0.25rem;
	}

	.copyright-name {
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
	}

	.copyright-divider {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		margin: 0 0.25rem;
	}

	.copyright-site {
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.footer-tagline {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
		font-style: italic;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	@media (max-width: 480px) {
		footer {
			padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem;
		}

		.copyright {
			font-size: 0.875rem;
		}

		.footer-tagline {
			font-size: 0.8125rem;
		}
	}

	@media print {
		footer {
			display: none !important;
		}
	}
</style>
